# 3DS Modding
A structured repository tracking the full Nintendo 3DS modding lifecycle: firmware mods, CIA management, SD optimization, homebrew experimentation, and recovery documentation.


# GOALS:
Build a stable, long-term modded 3DS
Learn 3DS internals and CFW tools
Maintain a clean install history
Avoid bricking
Be able to fully recover at any time
Create a reference for future systems/users
It acts as a living reference for my 3DS system, future upgrades, and any expirementation I do with homebrew or firmware.


# Project Board
Associated Project: 3DS Modding Roadmap
This Github Project tracks every stage of the modding journey:
setup steps
installs
expirements
storage planning
cleanup tasks
future ideas


